		(property "Description" "2x5 1.27 mm keyed shrouded SMD header for the display ribbon (I2C OLED now, SPI display possible). 1 3V3, 2 GND, 3 SDA (I2C1), 4 GND, 5 SCL (I2C1), 6 GPIO19 = SPI0 MOSI / spare, 7 GPIO15 = wing RESET line (reset button in, display reset out) or TFT backlight PWM, 8 GPIO16 = BTN_A or SPI0 MISO / DC, 9 GPIO17 = BTN_B or SPI0 CS, 10 GPIO18 = BTN_C or SPI0 SCK"
